			description: [
				"&7[NCP Field Memo #0104: Tooling]"
				""
				"GregTech parts are made with GregTech tools. Plates need a hammer, casings a wrench, the hull's cables a wire cutter."
				"The &bscrewdriver&r is part of the wire cutter, and the Primitive Blast Furnace needs one too."
				"&aThe wrought iron hammer also digs deeper:&r break gravel with it to find &bStannic&r (tin), &bCarbonic&r (coal) and &bPlumbic&r (lead) strata."
			]
			id: "076E7CC3AFDAC867"
