		{
			dependencies: ["70EDF0098A06DF89"]
			description: [
				"&7[NCP Field Memo #0107: Power]"
				""
				"GregTech machines eat &bEU&r; cheap generators make &bFE&r. NCP bridges the two:"
				"&aSolar panels&r (Solar Flux, 16 FE/t each in daylight, no hull) -> an &bEnergy Cell&r (Powah, stores the day"
				"for the night) -> a &bULV Energy Converter&r (4 FE = 1 EU, starts in FE to EU mode) -> GregTech cable -> machines."
				"A ULV machine draws up to 8 EU/t = 32 FE/t: two panels per machine in daylight, more to fill the cell."
				"Panels and cells push into whatever touches them; Pipez energy pipes carry FE further."
				"&aBackup:&r the Powah &bFurnator&r burns coal (8 carbon atoms = 1 coal). Every panel tier is 4 of the last plus that tier's circuit."
				"&7The NCP Emergency Solar (GregTech's ULV panel) still exists, but it costs a hull per 8 EU/t."
			]
			id: "37E06DD9764C4021"
			rewards: [
				{
					count: 4
					id: "5DB723201558572F"
					item: "positronics:ncp_scrip"
					type: "item"
				}
