		{
			dependencies: ["076E7CC3AFDAC867"]
			description: [
				"&7[NCP Field Memo #0111: Rubber]"
				""
				"No rubber trees, no resin; no resin, no rubber trees. Positronic Memory breaks the loop:"
				"rubber is isoprene, C5H8, atom for atom on the crafting table:"
				"&b1 carbon + 4 hydrogen = 1 methane&r (CH4); &b2 methane + 3 carbon = 2 sticky resin&r."
				"&aRubber plate by hand:&r mortar + 2 sticky resin = raw rubber dust; smelt it into a rubber plate."
				"A wire + a rubber plate = a cable. The hull needs two."
				"&aRubber trees:&r plant the saplings in dirt and let them grow. Break the tree's own logs: each one"
				"drops sticky resin most of the time. Logs you placed yourself, or from a botany pot, give none."
			]
			id: "45ED338A938645F1"
			rewards: [
				{
					count: 2
					id: "793BD3CFED095A55"
					item: "positronics:ncp_scrip"
					type: "item"
				}
				{
