		}
		{
			dependencies: ["271F6CBDB4715876"]
			description: [
				"&7[NCP Field Memo #0112: Memory]"
				""
				"Your first ingot. Now meet the &bTransmutation Tablet&r: four iron, four glass and your NCP Scrip as a login."
				"It reads and writes &bPositronic Memory&r (EMC). Memory only understands &bchemistry&r (elements and molecules): an iron"
				"ingot means nothing to it, but sixteen &biron atoms&r (ChemLib) do. Burn an element into the tablet to learn it; spend EMC to make more."
				"Later, the &bDissolver&r (LV) turns your production into elements, and a GregTech compressor packs 16 elements"
				"back into one dust, one tier after the metal is first needed. The planets still have to be done by hand."
				"&7Enclosed: 20 carbon and 20 hydrogen atoms. Burn one of each to learn them; the rest is your first rubber (see Rubber)."
			]
			id: "69ADFFCDC361D941"
			rewards: [
				{
					count: 2
					id: "72B102FFF455806A"
					item: "positronics:ncp_scrip"
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					count: 20
					id: "50A3B7F64BC625A0"
					item: "chemlib:carbon"
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					count: 20
					id: "08C5A3FDDFE4E313"
					item: "chemlib:hydrogen"
					type: "item"
				}
			]
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "1F04F17F385F072F"
					item: "minecraft:iron_ingot"
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					id: "62E7F4FFB3A9704F"
					item: "projecte:transmutation_tablet"
					type: "item"
				}
			]
			title: "Positronic Memory"
			x: 5.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["69ADFFCDC361D941"]
			description: [
				"&7[NCP Field Memo #0118: Biomass]"
				""
				"Positronic Memory reads chemistry, and every plant is made of it. Plants are &bcellulose&r: C6H10O5, 21 atoms."
				"&aMortar + 8 leaves&r (or 4 saplings, 8 crops, 8 sugar cane) = 1 &bplant mass&r."
				"&aMortar + 2 plant mass&r = 1 &bcellulose&r, worth exactly its 6 carbon, 10 hydrogen and 5 oxygen."
				"&aMortar + 1 rock dust&r (sand broken with a steel hammer) = 1 &bsilicon dioxide&r. Stone pays less than plants."
				"Burn a cellulose into the tablet to learn it; then every one you grow is EMC."
				"Need the atoms themselves (rubber needs carbon and hydrogen)? Spend that EMC on them in the tablet."
				"&7Enclosed: sugar cane. It grows in a botany pot and it is the fastest biomass you have."
				"&7Leaves need shears; the NCP Shop sells a reinforced pair."
			]
			id: "556BA39D6B479B11"
			rewards: [
				{
					count: 2
					id: "1AA4009389D0AE56"
					item: "positronics:ncp_scrip"
					type: "item"
				}
				{
