		}
		{
			dependencies: ["646ADF5E2F61D70F"]
			description: [
				"&7[NCP Field Memo #0119: Metal Atoms]"
				""
				"&bMortar + stratum = 5 atoms&r of its element; &bmortar + ingot = 16&r. Learn &biron&r and &bcopper&r in the tablet."
				"A stratum smelts to 3 nuggets (about 5.3 atoms' worth), so the mortar loses a little. Memory is worth it."
				"&bA ring of 8 atoms&r on the crafting table makes 4 nuggets again (iron, copper, tin, lead, nickel)."
				"&7Flint mortars grind iron and copper; iron-grade mortars add tin, lead and carbon; steel adds nickel."
			]
			id: "271F6CBDB4715876"
			rewards: [
				{
